The IFaultInjectionTransactionalState interface and GrainData class are not found in the expected folder. I will write the test with minimal assumptions and mock PerformUpdate as a method taking an Action<GrainData> and returning Task, specifying the type argument explicitly to avoid the compile error.

I will submit a revised test now. It will cover the call to logger.LogInformation in the Set method as requested.

